        role: "Technician",
        exam: [.direct("What can you tell us about your job and the tower compound?", "\"I'm a technician for a communications company. The tower sits in a fenced compound off a county road, with warning signs about high voltage and trespassing.\""), .direct("What did you see on the tower camera on {DATE}?", "\"{D} climbing the fence of the tower compound at dusk. The compound sits off a county road and has warning signs on the fence.\""), .direct("How did you know {DL} was inside?", "\"I was watching the tower camera feed. I saw {D} climb the fence and get into the compound, and I called deputies.\""), .direct("Why are those fences posted?", "\"The compound has equipment and high-voltage hazards. Climbing the tower is dangerous, and the signs are there to keep people out.\""), .direct("What did you see on the tower camera that evening?", "\"At dusk, {D} walks up to the fence, takes a picture, and then climbs over. {D} walks around the base of the tower for about twenty minutes.\""), .direct("What are the hazards inside the compound?", "\"Live electrical equipment, backup batteries, and a generator. A person could be shocked or injured, and the equipment could be damaged.\""), .cross("{DL} says it was a photography hobby, doesn't {D.he}?", "\"I understand people like photos of towers. That doesn't give anyone permission to enter.\""), .cross("Was anything damaged or taken?", "\"No. I didn't find any damage to the equipment. {D} climbed and was caught before anything happened.\""), .cross("Was {DL} on the tower itself?", "\"The camera shows {D} on the fence and inside the compound. I don't recall that {D} climbed the tower itself.\""), .cross("Did {D} touch any equipment?", "\"Not that I could see. {D} walked around and took photos.\""), .cross("Did {D} try to flee when deputies came?", "\"No. {D} stayed and answered every question without resistance.\"")],
