        openings: ("A cell tower compound off a county road is fenced and posted with warning signs. At dusk, {D} climbed the fence, and the tower camera recorded it. The State will show the video and the technician who watched.", "The defense evidence includes a hobby photographer who wanted a picture, touched nothing, and was cooperative with deputies. This was curiosity, not a threat."),
