        role: "Custodian",
        exam: [.direct("Tell us about your job and the playground.", "\"I'm the custodian at the elementary school. The playground behind the building is closed after dark, with a sign at the gate.\""), .direct("When did you find {D} on the playground?", "\"At about 9 p.m., on the swings behind the school, with a cooler. {D} had arrived around 8:45.\""), .direct("What is posted at the playground?", "\"A sign closing the playground after dark. It is posted at the gate, and everyone is supposed to see it.\""), .direct("Did you warn {D}?", "\"Twice. I asked {D} to leave both times, and {D} stayed on the swings.\""), .direct("What did you see that evening?", "\"At about 8:45, a person came through the gate, sat on a swing, and opened a cooler. I watched for a few minutes and then called out.\""), .direct("What did you say?", "\"That the playground was closed and the person needed to leave. I said it twice, and the second time the person said they were waiting for someone.\""), .cross("Was any child in the playground at that hour?", "\"No. It was after dark, and no children were there.\""), .cross("Was {D} causing any trouble?", "\"No. {D} was sitting on the swings with a cooler. I had no complaint except that the playground was closed.\""), .cross("Did {D} threaten you?", "\"No. {D} was calm. {D} just did not leave.\""), .cross("Did anyone else come to the playground?", "\"Not that I saw. No children and no adults.\""), .cross("Did {D} say why {D} was on the swings?", "\"{D} said {D} was waiting for a child to be picked up. I did not see any child, and no one came for the whole time I watched.\"")],
