        closings: ("Five takings on camera, $320 gone, and a family that had paid {D} every week. {D} told no one and took what was not offered.", "{D} believed the family owed {D} for extra hours. A wrong belief about a debt is not the same as an intent to steal, and the State must prove that intent."),
