        openings: ("The owner of a bar banned {D} in writing, and a month later, at 9 p.m., {D} walked back in. The owner asked {D} to leave, and deputies came twenty minutes later. The State will show the ban letter.", "The defense will point you to a patron who believed a month-old ban had run its course, sat in plain view, and was never a threat. This was a misunderstanding."),
