        role: "Pedestrian",
        exam: [.direct("Tell the jury where you were that evening.", "\"Walking home along a residential street at about eight. It was getting dark and I had my phone in my hand.\""), .direct("What happened to you on the street?", "\"A paintball hit me from a slow-moving car at about 8:01 p.m. It stung, and a welt came up on my arm.\""), .direct("How was the car moving?", "\"Slowly. It passed on the street, and then I was hit.\""), .direct("What did the doorbell camera show?", "\"{D}'s car passing at 8 p.m. and the paintball hitting me a minute later. I reported it at 8:10.\""), .direct("What happened as the car passed?", "\"A car moved slowly alongside me with the window down. A paintball hit me on the thigh, and I yelled and ran toward a porch.\""), .direct("What injury did you have?", "\"A welt about the size of a half-dollar, with bruising by the next day. I reported it at 8:10.\""), .cross("Could you see who fired?", "\"No. I saw the car, not the person. I cannot say who held the gun.\""), .cross("Did you see a gun?", "\"Not clearly. I only felt the hit.\""), .cross("Did you see the person who fired?", "\"No. I only saw the car and the hand coming out of the window.\""), .cross("Did you see more than one person in the car?", "\"I saw a shape in the front and maybe another in the back. I couldn't be sure.\""), .cross("Did {D} say anything to you after the shot?", "\"No. The car kept moving, and I heard laughing. I did not see anyone get out, so I called the sheriff after I checked the welt.\"")],
